direction: right
Documents: Knowledge sources {shape: document}
Parser: Parse and chunk {shape: rectangle}
Embed: Embedding model {shape: rectangle}
Vectors: Vector database {shape: cylinder}
User: User {shape: person}
App: Chat application {shape: page}
Retriever: Retriever {shape: rectangle}
Prompt: Prompt builder {shape: rectangle}
LLM: Language model {shape: cloud}
Documents -> Parser
Parser -> Embed
Embed -> Vectors
User -> App: question
App -> Retriever
Retriever -> Embed: embed query
Retriever -> Vectors: similarity search
Retriever -> Prompt: context
App -> Prompt: question
Prompt -> LLM
LLM -> App: grounded answer
